window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Underhill has been killed and the only thing standing between all realms and utter destruction by Unbalance and his minions….</p><p></p><p>Is me.</p><p></p><p>Named as the new Mistress of Underhill, I must gather those I trust to untangle the deadly riddles or I will be left to face the darkness alone.</p><p></p><p>The politics of the earth and fae realms, the survival of all, and the remains of my tattered heart will all be decided in a final battle.</p><p></p><p>But as more and more players enter this war of realms, I realize that things are not what they seemed. If I am to see this through to the end, I must do what my mother asked of me.</p><p></p><p>Somehow I must embrace a destiny that feels impossible… and give up on a love impossible to deny.</p><p></p><p>Adapted from the novel and produced with a full cast of actors, immersive sound effects and cinematic music!</p><p></p><p>Performed by Aure Nash, Mike Carnes, Hedra Knight, Morgan Dalla Betta, John Kielty, Renee Dorian, Nicole Perez, Tia Shearer, Ryan Dalusung, NJ Agwuna, Jonathan Lee Taylor, Shanta Parasuraman, Belsheber Rusape, Ellen Quay, Sam Intrater, Stewart Crank, David Engel, DeJeanette Horne, James Konicek, Nick J. Russo, Gabriel Michael, Megan Hastie, Jeri J. Marshall, Eric Messner, and Crystal Lee.</p>"; 
